{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:cf00259b632e97a9","name":"Holocron Loremaster","source":{"id":"source:reference-cf00259b632e97a9","title":"Holocron Loremaster","revision":20437,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:50:45Z","sha256":"f9403494c83b882968156be0cec80b97d0e0b7ede3d5d1a0fce8535afa9d97f0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20437","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Holocron%20Loremaster&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-cf00259b632e97a9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you activate a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to add one use of any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," known by any ally within 12 squares of you (whether you know that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," or not) to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power Suite"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power_Suite"},". Once used, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," cannot be regained by any means, and if the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," is not used by the end of your next turn, it is lost. You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Destiny Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Destiny_Point"}," to have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," lost at the end of the encounter instead of the end of your next turn.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Additionally, you can enhance any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocron"}," you possess, adding your knowledge to its memory. You can create a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocron Gatekeeper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocron_Gatekeeper"}," in your own image in that ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holocron"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holocron"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
